WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.531
<v Alex>Welcome to the show. Today we turned a long research paper into this episode,

00:00:05.531 --> 00:00:08.316
<v Alex>and neither of us recorded a single word.

00:00:09.216 --> 00:00:13.781
<v Sam>That's right, Alex. Our voices were cloned from two short sample clips,

00:00:13.781 --> 00:00:18.475
<v Sam>and the transcript, chapters and RSS feed were written out automatically.
